 "source": "ADR-0006 revision 6 (M06 wave 0; section 18): one request of every form ADR-0012 section 9 item 6 names (env add, invite, join, activation probe (revision 6.1), revoke-client, remove, update and status; device retire; route add, remove and prefer; transport enable and disable; roost adopt; the runner-internal prepare_remote_grant, install_certificate, TimeChallenge/TimeResponse, deliver_effect with each typed target of ADR-0012 section 7.2, authority_report and ResolveRouteBinding), with the operation kind, the admission and the capability each names (transcribed from section 18.1, never from the code). There is no RemoteDecide and no serve-child lease or suspend message. Synthetic values only: documentation addresses (192.0.2.0/24), a placeholder certificate and fingerprint. Revision 6.3 (M06 wave 3; section 18.7) adds remote_environment rotate_endpoint and runner_policy_recheck, transport rotate, and the runner_local forms (trust_issuer, designate_time_source, distrust_issuer, clear_time_source, enroll_owner, policy_recheck), all in `requests`; `no_capability_requests` holds the controller_record forms (put_environment, remove_environment), which need no capability beyond operations/1 and are asserted separately; the revision-6.3 rows' kind, admission and capability are read from Request::kind, Request::admission and Request::required_capability.",
